ibbons or other Christmas decorations to create a personalised festive arrangement. PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: Garland length: 270 cm. Packaging dimensions: 60 cm (H) × 50 cm (W) × 10 cm (D). Weight: 850 g. 2.7M CHRISTMAS GARLAND: Measures 270 cm in length, providing generous coverage for decorating fireplaces, staircases, doorways, banisters and other festive display areas. REALISTIC PINE APPEARANCE: Designed with cedar-style artificial pine foliage to create a full, traditional green Christmas look around the home. FLEXIBLE AND ADJUSTABLE: The branches can be shaped and positioned to help create a fuller display and suit different decorating spaces. DURABLE PVC MATERIAL: Made from polyvinyl chloride for a practical artificial garland that can be reused as part of seasonal decorations. INDOOR AND OUTDOOR USE: Suitable for decorating a range of indoor and outdoor areas during the Christmas season. PLAIN GREEN DESIGN: Supplied without integrated lights, allowing you to personalise the garland with your own lights, ornaments, ribbons or decorations. Read the instructions before use Dreibach LTD, Unit 2 Capital Business Park, Manaor Way, WD6 1GW, United Kingdom.","productSummary":"Create a traditional festive display with the GloBrite 2.7m Artificial Pine Christmas Garland. Measuring 270 cm in length, this plain green garland features realistic cedar-style pine foliage for a full and natural-looking finish. Ideal for decorating fireplaces, staircases, doorways and banisters, it is made from durable PVC with flexible branches that can be shaped and adjusted to suit different spaces. Suitable for indoor and outdoor use, this unlit garland can be combined with lights, baubles, ribbons or other Christmas decorations to create a personalised festive arrangement. PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: Garland length: 270 cm. Packaging dimensions: 60 cm (H) × 50 cm (W) × 10 cm (D). Weight: 850 g. 2.7M CHRISTMAS GARLAND: Measures 270 cm in length, providing generous coverage for decorating fireplaces, 